  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "The logic followed here is :-\n\nBy using BODMAS RULE :\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/4671232025562bc3ba9a781319d633acf8cd8e78dc8e96912cd7564a7df4717d.png] \n\n \n \n\n **Symbols**\n **Stands for**\n \n \n\n ÷ \n +\n \n \n\n -\n × \n \n \n\n +\n -\n \n \n\n × \n ÷ \n \n \n\nOption 1) : 42 × 28 - 30 ÷ 48 + 45 = 45\n\nAfter interchanging the given symbols the equation is as follows : 42 ÷ 28 × 30 + 48 - 45 = 45\n\n⇒ __**42 ÷ 28**__ × 30 + 48 - 45 = 45\n\n⇒ __**1.5 × 30**__ + 48 - 45 = 45\n\n⇒ __**45 + 48**__ - 45 = 45\n\n⇒ __**93 - 45**__ = 45\n\n⇒ 48 ≠ 45\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) : 42 × 28 - 30 ÷ 48 + 45 = 50\n\nAfter interchanging the given symbols the equation is as follows : 42 ÷ 28 × 30 + 48 - 45 = 50\n\n⇒ __**42 ÷ 28**__ × 30 + 48 - 45 = 50\n\n⇒ __**1.5 × 30**__ + 48 - 45 = 50\n\n⇒ __**45 + 48**__ - 45 = 50\n\n⇒ __**93 - 45**__ = 50\n\n⇒ 48 ≠ 50\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) : 42 × 28 - 30 ÷ 48 + 45 = 48\n\nAfter interchanging the given symbols the equation is as follows : 42 ÷ 28 × 30 + 48 - 45 = 48\n\n⇒ __42 ÷ 28__ × 30 + 48 - 45 = 48\n\n⇒ __1.5 × 30__ + 48 - 45 = 48\n\n⇒ __45 + 48__ - 45 = 48\n\n⇒ __93 - 45__ = 48\n\n**⇒ 48 = 48**\n\n**LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 4) : 42 × 28 - 30 ÷ 48 + 45 = 40\n\nAfter interchanging the given symbols the equation is as follows : 42 ÷ 28 × 30 + 48 - 45 = 40\n\n⇒ __42 ÷ 28__ × 30 + 48 - 45 = 40\n\n⇒ __1.5 × 30__ + 48 - 45 = 40\n\n⇒ __45 + 48__ - 45 = 40\n\n⇒ __93 - 45__ = 40\n\n⇒ 48 ≠ 40\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"42 ****× 28 - 30 ÷ 48 + 45 = 48\".**",
